{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49386","headline":"喜迁莺 · 毛文锡","name":"喜迁莺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳春景，暧晴烟。\n乔木见莺迁，传枝偎叶语关关，飞过绮丛间。\n锦翼鲜，金毳輭。\n百转千娇相唤，碧纱窗晓怕闻声，惊破鸳鸯暖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛文锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49386.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49386","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}